  m_text: "\u201CIn operation and control of modern aircraft and spacecraft, power MOSFETs  (metal oxide field effect transistors) are semiconductor switching devices that are instrumental in electronics equipment, and act as fast electronic switches and signal amplifiers in digital, analog, and power electronics. They basically are high-efficiency switches, to step voltage levels up or down.\u201D  "
