  m_text: "\u201CLi-ion batteries are the primary energy storage. They store electricity generated by solar panels and supply power when the spacecraft's view of the Sun is blocked or when demand exceeds solar output. They are also critical life support and communication systems on platforms such as the International Space Station (ISS).\u201D\r\n"
