  m_text: "\u201CThe Pistol Grip Tool (PGT) is a handy tool present in every spacecraft. As a non-powered ratched wrench, this instrument will be used by astronauts during extravehicle activity to torque servicing support equipment, mechanical interfaces and fasteners.\u201D"
